codex
Both IQ80321 and Iyonix explicitly install CP6. The regression directory also contains several ARM guest probes, so the premise that it may lack an ARM vehicle needs correcting. The timer comment has a separate counting error: eight registers have sixteen read/write arms, and all sixteen are quiet.
